        ],
        "text": "The dispute centers on whether states have the authority to regulate electricity transmission, or whether that authority belongs to the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "FERC; State",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d335501401b3d8804c6a1f43bb23e49f997234e7915398e825ed1088184a0038",
            "evidence_ids": [
