              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 54,
                "start": 54
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to FERC, interpreting the statute under Chevron, FERC concluded the agency could go either way regarding jurisdiction."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Respondent (Mr. Cohen)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "d335501401b3d8804c6a1f43bb23e49f997234e7915398e825ed1088184a0038",
